{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>以下是Friday（週五）在五角大樓舉行的九一一事件25周年紀念儀式的一段影片，片中可見美國總統Donald Trump。</p>\n<p>以下有幾張相片：</p>\n<img src=\"https://img.huffingtonpost.com/asset/6aa446723c000049844e6e6f.jpeg?cache=BOviB0ggk0&amp;ops=scalefit_720_noupscale\"/>\n<img src=\"https://img.huffingtonpost.com/asset/6aa452b33c0000b3874e6e75.jpeg?ops=scalefit_720_noupscale\"/>\n<img src=\"https://img.huffingtonpost.com/asset/6aa4465f170000bd5220134f.jpeg?ops=scalefit_720_noupscale\"/>\n<p>White House發言人Davis Ingle向《HuffPost》發表聲明表示：「Trump總統莊嚴肅穆地聆聽並悼念在那天不幸罹難的遇害者及英勇的救援人員。任何荒謬地聲稱總統睡著了的人都是在說謊。」</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T15:19:32.590221+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":450,"images":3,"source":"HuffPost 新聞","fallback":"none"}}